{"audio": "transcribe/finetune/data/Short4 mine.draft/0000.wav", "text": "หนูไม่ได้โง่นะคะพี่", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1968, "duration_ms": 1968, "source": "CFD90_Short4_20260713", "origin": "srt"}
{"audio": "transcribe/finetune/data/Short4 mine.draft/0001.wav", "text": "แต่หนูทำใจไม่ได้ต่างหากที่ต้องเสียเขาไป", "start_ms": 1968, "end_ms": 5205, "duration_ms": 3237, "source": "CFD90_Short4_20260713", "origin": "srt"}
